###

### Import GPUs from Excel
# Parameter name must be "file"
POST {{PcBuilderBackend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/master-data/gpu/import
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----GpuImportBoundary
Accept: application/json

------GpuImportBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="gpus.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./gpus.xlsx
------GpuImportBoundary--

